   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ている: action in progress",
     "texto": [
      "To say an action **is in progress**, use the て form + **います**: **たべています** (is eating). The context can show whether it is happening now or over a period."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ている: states",
     "texto": [
      "With some verbs **〜ている** doesn't describe an action but a **state**: **すんでいます** (lives in), **けっこんしています** (is married), **しっています** (knows).",
      "These are phrases that will be very useful for talking about your family and your life."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
